# 0933 (x16 E): a second served id whose requests default to the background class, behind
# TENSORFOLD_NAME_PRIORITY (default "": off) and --name-priority (id=class, repeated). The fleet's serve scripts set
# the env form (e.g. TENSORFOLD_NAME_PRIORITY=glm-5.3-flash-bg=background); cli.py serves the id (start.sh passes it
# as --alias) and hands {id: class} to App, which defaults a request from such an id to "background" before
# request_class orders admission (TENSORFOLD_PRIORITY must be on; an explicit priority in the body always wins).
